abstract: "Independent concept study of a proposed Meta Quest 3 mixed-reality architecture with external thermal sensing, LoRa/Meshtastic and head-directed interaction. This repository documents a design rather than a verified integrated implementation. The historical source document is dated December 10, 2025; its first public publication date has not been independently established."
